        "## What this lesson does not do"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## What this lesson does not do"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "3d6e24473b1a60698adccf0a7db4156de497df6e1eb81ef1fd5b3ef9fde69ce6",
      "target": "本课不评分、不调用模型，也不运行代码。这些内容将在第 71、72 和 75 课中介绍。本课固定的是它们共同遵守的契约。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## What this lesson does not do"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## What this lesson does not do"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "16696f577a857e9360658cd88b52b39ae5ae7815b1b179d62943499f411e9e1e",
      "target": "包含 10 个任务的测试样例集涵盖两道算术题、两道选择题、两项代码执行任务、两项分类任务和两项摘要任务。全部 10 个任务都能通过验证。另一个独立的测试样例集（`tasks_bad.jsonl`）会触发每条规则，验证器返回的错误数量与之准确对应。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0068",
