      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "e5a56fe03b05ceb5355f03d2f90ab752d64799720341ce6af50a2d09c785e903",
      "target": "## 如何阅读代码\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0070",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## How to read the code"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## How to read the code"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "774b431c140134eac59bff395dae6ba6c1e4a891841613e1c87c7a979289c173",
      "target": "`main.py` 定义了 `TaskSpec`、`validate_task`、`validate_file` 和一个命令行接口（CLI）入口。测试样例加载器是 `load_fixtures`。拼接和后处理辅助函数与验证逻辑放在一起，因此第 75 课的运行器只需导入一个模块。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## How to read the code"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Task Spec Format",
        "## How to read the code"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "7069586116486d9152c31b0c406db87d9daaba9270783d7260911907ff33f159",
      "target": "从头到尾阅读 `main.py`，然后阅读 `code/tests/test_spec.py`。测试固定了每条验证规则和每种后处理行为。`main.py` 底部的演示会验证随附的测试样例集，并打印摘要。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "19-70:b0074",
